ption Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"65\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium List 1 Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"66\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium List 2 Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"67\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Grid 1 Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"68\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Grid 2 Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"69\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Grid 3 Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"70\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Dark List Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"71\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Colorful Shading Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"72\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Colorful List Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"73\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Colorful Grid Accent 6\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"19\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Subtle Emphasis\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"21\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Intense Emphasis\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"31\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Subtle Reference\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"32\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Intense Reference\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"33\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Book Title\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"37\" Name=\"Bibliography\"/><w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"39\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"TOC Heading\"/></w:LatentStyles></xml><![endif]--><!-- [if gte mso 10]><style> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;} </style><![endif]--><!--StartFragment-->Seorang berjalan menuruni sebuah tangga eskalator yang sedang&nbsp;bergerak turun memerlukan waktu 1 menit. Jika kecepatan berjalannya diduakalikan maka memerlukan waktu 40 detik. Berapa waktu yang diperlukan jika orang tersebut relax (diam) ?<!--EndFragment-->&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM5NA"},{"id":"MzE-q02","number":2,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah bandul sederhana panjang tali <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;l\" />&nbsp;berotasi pada bidang horizontal (ayunan konis). Jika periode rotasinya&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;T\" />, tentukan besar sudut <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;\\theta\" />&nbsp;(nyatakan dalam&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;l\" />,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;T\" />&nbsp;dan <strong><img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;g\" /></strong>).</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../../uploads/image/file/416/5.JPG\" style=\"margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191010042648.PNG\" style=\"height:103px; width:120px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNQ"},{"id":"MzE-q03","number":3,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan percepatan masing-masing benda yang ditunjukkan pada gambar. Jika nilai&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m_{1}\" />,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m_{2}\" />&nbsp;dan <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\theta\" />&nbsp;diberikan.&nbsp;(Abaikan gesekan)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/417/6.JPG\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191010042731.PNG\" style=\"height:101px; width:227px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNg"},{"id":"MzE-q04","number":4,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah sistem ditunjukkan&nbsp;pada diagram berikut,&nbsp;dimana&nbsp;kedua&nbsp;balok&nbsp;bebas&nbsp;bergerak dari keadaan diam tanpa gesekan. Mana yang pertama kali terjadi : balok A&nbsp;akan menyentuh katrol atau balok B akan menumbuk dinding? Abaikan semua gesekan.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/418/7.JPG\" /></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191010042814.PNG\" style=\"height:117px; width:244px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNw"},{"id":"MzE-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah koin dijatuhkan ke dalam sebuah sumur. Jika waktu total dari koin mulai dijatuhkan sampai terdengar bunyi pantulan bahwa koin telah menyentuh permukaan air adalah&nbsp;<em>T</em>, dan kecepatan gelombang suara <em>v</em> serta percepatan gravitasi <em>g</em>, nyatakan kedalaman permukaan air&nbsp; sumur dalam <em>T</em>,&nbsp;<em>v</em>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">dan </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><em>g</em>.</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyOA"},{"id":"MzE-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Seorang pemain ski melompat dengan sudut 370 dan laju <em>v0</em><em>&nbsp;</em>= 10 m/s, kemudian Ia mendarat dan menempuh jarak sejauh <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l\" />&nbsp;pada bidang miring (lihat gambar). Jika sudut kemiringan bidang&nbsp;450;&nbsp;Tentukan jarak&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l\" />&nbsp;yang ditempuh. (asumsikan <em>g</em>&nbsp;= 10 m/s2&nbsp;dan sin 370&nbsp;= 0,6)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../../uploads/image/file/419/8.JPG\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191010042903.PNG\" style=\"height:153px; width:208px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyOQ"},{"id":"MzE-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebatang tongkat homogen panjangnya <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l\" />&nbsp;dan massanya <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m\" />, salah satu ujungnya bersandar pada dinding licin dan membentuk sudut <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\theta\" />&nbsp;terhadap dinding, sedangkan ujung yang lain terletak pada lantai kasar.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/420/9.JPG\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191010043006.PNG\" style=\"height:126px; width:125px\" /></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->a.&nbsp;Tentukan nilai gaya kontak dinding terhadap tangga (nyatakan dalam <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m\" />,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;g\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\theta\" />).</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->b.&nbsp;Tentukan nilai gaya kontak dinding terhadap tangga jika sudut&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\theta\" />&nbsp;tidak&nbsp;diketahui tapi diketahui koefisien gesek statisnya&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\mu\" />&nbsp;(nyatakan dalam&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\mu\" />,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m\" />&nbsp;dan <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;g\" />).</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMA"},{"id":"MzE-q08","number":8,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah bandul&nbsp;diberi simpangan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\theta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\theta\" />&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">derajat&nbsp;dan&nbsp;berayun dengan periode&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small T\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;T\" />&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">detik. Apa&nbsp;yang terjadi dengan periode ayun bandul tersebut jika diberi&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">simpangan <img title=\"2\\theta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2\\theta\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">derajat? ( dimana</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><img title=\"\\theta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\theta\" /><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&lt; 5<sup>0</sup></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMQ"}]
